# 350MB portable Blender runtime — re-downloadable, never commit
blender-4.2.3-linux-x64/

# Heavy binary artifacts — present on disk, deliberately not versioned.
# ~3GB across these four; they bloat clones and two of them mirror
# third-party sites, which must not be republished from this repo.
#
# concepts/ + storyboards/  — our own Blender/concept renders, regenerable
#                             from build_strata.py + build_textures.py
# reference-capture/        — scraped frames/shaders from reference studio sites
# aten7-capture/            — scraped frames/shaders from aten7's site
concepts/
storyboards/
reference-capture/
aten7-capture/
